sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as API Client
    participant APIGateway as API Gateway
    participant RateLimitFilter as Rate Limit Filter
    participant TokenBucketService as Token Bucket Service
    participant Redis as Redis
    participant NotificationController as Notification Controller
    participant NotificationService as Notification Service
    participant OutboxPublisher as Outbox Publisher
    participant OutboxEvent as Outbox Event (DB)
    participant Postgres as PostgreSQL
    participant KafkaProducer as Kafka Producer
    participant KafkaTopic as Kafka Topic
    participant KafkaConsumer as Kafka Consumer
    participant EmailProvider as Email Provider
    participant SMSProvider as SMS Provider

    Client->>APIGateway: HTTP Request with X-User-ID
    APIGateway->>RateLimitFilter: Process Request
    RateLimitFilter->>TokenBucketService: Check Allowance
    TokenBucketService->>Redis: Get/Update Token Bucket (Lua Script)
    Redis-->>TokenBucketService: Allow/Deny Decision
    TokenBucketService-->>RateLimitFilter: Return Decision
    alt Request Allowed
        RateLimitFilter->>NotificationController: Continue Processing
        NotificationController->>NotificationService: Create Notification
        NotificationService->>OutboxPublisher: Publish Event
        OutboxPublisher->>OutboxEvent: Save to DB (Same TX)
        OutboxPublisher->>Postgres: INSERT OutboxEvent
        OutboxPublisher->>KafkaProducer: Send to Kafka (Async)
        KafkaProducer->>KafkaTopic: Publish Message
        KafkaTopic-->>KafkaConsumer: Deliver Message
        KafkaConsumer->>EmailProvider: Process Email Notification
        KafkaConsumer->>SMSProvider: Process SMS Notification
        EmailProvider->>KafkaConsumer: Ack/Update Status
        SMSProvider->>KafkaConsumer: Ack/Update Status
        KafkaConsumer->>Postgres: Update Notification Status
    else Request Denied
        RateLimitFilter->>Client: 429 Too Many Requests
        RateLimitFilter->>Client: Include Retry-After Header
    end